#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Color temperature"
msgstr "色温"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:198
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This paragraph explains various utilities that adjust screen colors based on "
"temperature, day/night cycles, and gamma settings.  These utilities enable "
"both interactive color adjustments and automatic changes based on the local "
"time and geographical location.  Some utilities are compatible with the "
"extref:{handbook}x11[X Window System], others support extref:{handbook}"
"wayland[Wayland], and some work on both display servers."
msgstr "本段介绍了多种实用程序，它们可根据色温、昼夜周期和伽马设置调整屏幕颜色。这些实用程序既支持交互式调色，也支持根据当地时间和地理位置自动调整。部分实用程序兼容 extref:{handbook}x11[X Window System]，另一些支持 extref:{handbook}wayland[Wayland]，还有一些同时支持这两种显示服务器。"

