#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:249
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"man:darkman[1] is a daemon that automatically manages transitions between "
"dark mode and light mode.  It operates primarily in the background, "
"switching the screen's color scheme based on the local time of the current "
"location.  To install, run:"
msgstr "man:darkman[1] 是一个守护进程，可自动管理深色模式和浅色模式之间的切换。它主要在后台运行，根据当前位置的当地时间切换屏幕配色方案。运行以下命令进行安装："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:253
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install darkman\n"
msgstr "# pkg install darkman\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:257
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Create the file [.filename]#~/.config/darkman/config.yaml# and write your "
"latitude and longitude.  Example:"
msgstr "创建文件 [.filename]#~/.config/darkman/config.yaml#，并写入纬度和经度。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:262
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"lat: 37.52\n"
"lng: 122.16\n"
msgstr "lat: 37.52\nlng: 122.16\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:268
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The utility does not directly change the screen colors; instead, it calls "
"external utilities to perform the color transitions.  Add scripts to be "
"executed at sundown by placing them in [.filename]#$XDG_DATA_DIRS/dark-mode."
"d/# and scripts to be executed at sunrise by placing them in [."
"filename]#XDG_DATA_DIRS/light-mode.d/#.  Several https://gitlab.com/"
"WhyNotHugo/darkman/-/tree/main/examples[example scripts] are available in "
"the project repository."
