#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:457
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Ports Collection"
msgstr "Ports Collection"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:463
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FreeBSD provides the extref:{handbook}ports[Ports Collection], which offers "
"a simple way to install applications.  Some ports allow you to configure "
"options before building and installation.  By default, configuration is "
"handled through a TUI menu built by the package:ports-mgmt/portconfig[].  "
"The colors can be customized in several ways:"
msgstr "FreeBSD 提供 extref:{handbook}ports[Ports Collection]，让安装应用程序变得简单。一些 port 允许您在构建和安装之前配置选项。默认情况下，配置通过 package:ports-mgmt/portconfig[] 构建的 TUI 菜单进行处理。可以通过以下几种方式自定义颜色："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:465
#, fuzzy
msgid "Terminal color capabilities."
msgstr "终端颜色功能。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:466
#, fuzzy
msgid "The $NO_COLOR environment variable."
msgstr "$NO_COLOR 环境变量。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:467
#, fuzzy
msgid "The $PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE environment variable."
msgstr "$PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE 环境变量。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:468
#, fuzzy
msgid "The global [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/portconfig/theme.conf# file."
msgstr "全局 [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/portconfig/theme.conf# 文件。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:472
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These methods are listed in order of decreasing priority and are mutually "
"exclusive, meaning only one can be active at a time."
msgstr "这些方法按优先级从高到低排列，且互斥，也就是说同一时间只能启用一种方法。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:475
#, fuzzy
msgid "*1. Terminal Colors*"
msgstr "*1. 终端颜色*"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:478
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"man:portconfig[1] automatically detects whether the terminal supports "
"colors.  If not, it defaults to a black-and-white theme."
msgstr "man:portconfig[1] 会自动检测终端是否支持颜色。如果不支持，则默认使用黑白主题。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:480
#, fuzzy
msgid "*2. NO_COLOR*"
msgstr "*2. NO_COLOR*"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:482
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the `$NO_COLOR` environment variable is set and not empty, portconfig "
"forces the black-and-white theme"
msgstr "如果设置了 `$NO_COLOR` 环境变量且其值不为空，portconfig 将强制使用黑白主题"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:483
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Example persistent setting `$NO_COLOR`"
msgstr "示例：持久设置 `$NO_COLOR`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:487
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:503
#, fuzzy
msgid "[.filename]#/etc/make.conf#"
msgstr "[.filename]#/etc/make.conf#"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:491
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "export NO_COLOR=YES\n"
msgstr "export NO_COLOR=YES\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:495
#, fuzzy
msgid "*3. PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE*"
msgstr "*3. PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE*"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:498
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the `$PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE` environment variable is set and points to a "
"valid theme file, it will be used.  Otherwise, the default theme is applied."
msgstr "如果设置了 `$PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE` 环境变量且其指向有效的主题文件，则会使用该文件。否则，将应用默认主题。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:500
#, fuzzy
msgid "..Example persistent setting `$PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE`"
msgstr "..示例：持久设置 `$PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE`"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:507
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "export PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE=/home/foo/mytheme.conf\n"
msgstr "export PORTCONFIG_THEMEFILE=/home/foo/mytheme.conf\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:513
#, fuzzy
msgid "To create a new theme file, run:"
