#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:542
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Brightness"
msgstr "亮度"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:546
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Screen brightness can be adjusted in various ways.  The available methods "
"depend heavily on the hardware, so it's recommended to try the features "
"described in the following sections."
msgstr "可以通过多种方式调整屏幕亮度。可用的方法很大程度上取决于硬件，因此建议尝试以下各节介绍的功能。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:548
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "backlight"
msgstr "backlight"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:552
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The man:backlight[8] utility is included with the operating system.  It is "
"used to set the brightness of devices located under [.filename]#/dev/"
"backlight/#."
msgstr "操作系统自带 man:backlight[8] 实用程序。它用于设置 [.filename]#/dev/backlight/# 下设备的亮度。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:555
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The command `backlight -f _device_ _value_` sets the brightness of _device_ "
"to _value_, where _value_ is an integer between 0 (dim) and 100 (bright).  "
"If no device is specified, the default device [.filename]#/dev/backlight/"
"backlight0# is considered."
msgstr "命令 `backlight -f _device_ _value_` 将 __device__ 的亮度设置为 __value__，其中 __value__ 是介于 0（暗）和 100（亮）之间的整数。如果未指定设备，则使用默认设备 [.filename]#/dev/backlight/backlight0#。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:557
#, fuzzy
msgid "Example for setting the brightness of the default device to 50%:"
msgstr "将默认设备的亮度设置为 50% 的示例："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:561
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% backlight 50\n"
msgstr "% backlight 50\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/colors/_index.adoc:566
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Unless the user belongs to the \"video\" group, the command needs to run as "
"root."
msgstr "除非用户属于 \"video\" 组，否则该命令必须以 root 身份运行。"

#. type: Title ===
